@startuml

title Distributed Tracing: the context a hop carries and the records it leaves

hide empty methods
class "trace context (W3C traceparent)" as ctx {
  version : 00
  trace_id : 16 bytes, the whole action
  parent_id : 8 bytes, the caller's span
  flags : sampled or not
}
class "span" as span {
  trace_id
  span_id : 8 bytes, this hop
  parent_span_id
  name : the subject handled
  start, end
  status
}
class "log record" as log {
  timestamp, severity, body
  trace_id
  span_id
}
ctx --> span : a hop starts a span\nwhose parent is parent_id
span "1" --> "*" log : each log line of the hop
note bottom of ctx : the correlation id of a request\nbecomes its trace_id
@enduml
